                    as part of the PDS3 VG2-U-MAG-4-RDR-U1COORDS-1.92SEC-V1.0 data set. 
                    The metadata have been migrated to PDS4. The data themselves are unchanged.
                </description>
            </Modification_Detail>
        </Modification_History>
